1. DEFINITIONS

   "Software" means the materials in this directory together with the
   Enterprise Features they enable.

   "Enterprise Features" means functionality that ArcLoom makes available only
   when a valid Enterprise License is installed, including (as of this writing)
   OIDC single sign-on, per-project access control and audit logging, scheduled
   drift detection, and use beyond the community user limit. The specific set of
   gated features may change between releases.

   "Enterprise License" means a valid, unexpired license key issued in writing
   by the Licensor (or a party the Licensor authorizes), together with any
   accompanying order form or agreement.

   "License Gate" means the mechanism in ArcLoom that verifies an Enterprise
   License and enables or disables Enterprise Features accordingly (including,
   without limitation, the code in internal/license and its enforcement points).

